<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Topstyle shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Topstyle shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of silk garment maker Topstyle International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$0.27 or 77.14 percent to HK$0.62 prior to the trading suspension at the start of the afternoon suspension.</p>
<p>Volume was 994,000 shares worth HK$519,700.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
